{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object, grab it if possible, process it, otherwise fallback and try to move or turn. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveBackward    /> <Action ID = TurnLeft    /> <Action ID = TurnRight    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    />\"",
